  "claim": "Creeks separates the islands where the awards, where Femi Jacobs won the award for Best Actor in a Golden Icons Academy Movie Awards, were held.",
  "evidencia": "Page: 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards. Sentence: The 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards (AMVCA) was held on March 7, 2015 at the Eko Hotel and Suites, Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria.\nPage: Lagos. Sentence: Lagos initially emerged as a port city which originated on a collection of islands, which are contained in the present day Local Government Areas (LGAs) of Lagos Island, Eti-Osa, Amuwo-Odofin and Apapa; the islands are separated by creeks, fringing the southwest mouth of Lagos Lagoon, while protected from the Atlantic Ocean by barrier islands and long sand spits such as Bar Beach, which stretch up to 100 km east and west of the mouth.\nPage: Femi Jacobs. Sentence: He also won the award for Best Actor in a Comedy at the 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards (AMVCA).",
