        "original_id": "dff87fd6-ae2c-505b-849e-357064d5d766",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards\n- Places: Eko Hotel and Suites, Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria, Lagos Lagoon, Atlantic Ocean, Bar Beach\n- People: Femi Jacobs\n- Topics: Lagos geography, Lagos origins\n\nFacts:\n- Lagos initially emerged as a port city on a collection of islands in the present-day Local Government Areas of Lagos Island, Eti-Osa, Amuwo-Odofin, and Apapa.\n- The islands of Lagos are separated by creeks at the southwest mouth of Lagos Lagoon and are protected from the Atlantic Ocean by barrier islands and long sand spits such as Bar Beach that extend up to 100 km east and west of the mouth.\n- The 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards was held on March 7, 2015, at the Eko Hotel and Suites in Victoria Island, Lagos, Nigeria.\n- Femi Jacobs won the award for Best Actor in a Comedy at the 2015 Africa Magic Viewers Choice Awards.",
